<title>JAPAN: Nadex says to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Nadex says to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nadex Co Ltd said on Wednesday it would buy back up to 480,000 shares of its shares, or up to 500 million yen worth.</p>
<p>Nadex is a machinery trader.</p>
</text>
